to install:

1. If you wann use my mango/hypr config make sure to change the monitor res and refresh rate to match ur monitor!
2. put these files in .config
3. if u wanna use my kitty config make sure to install fish shell first

programs:
kitty (term) bind = SUPER + Q
mango or hyprland (WM)
fuzzel or rofi (app launcher) bind = use alt + space
neovim (code/text editor)
fastfetch (fetching tool)
waybar (the bar)
swaybg (for the wallpaper)
pamixer (for adjusting volume) bind = alt + [ to decrease and alt + ] to increase
Librewolf (browser)

how to get the running cat script working on waybar:
1, go to .config/waybar/scripts
2. Find a file called "Waycat.ttf"
3. copy or move that file to ~/.local/share/fonts
4. run "fc-cache -f -v
5. restart waybar
